{
  "info": {
    "name": "GainMiles Product API",
    "description": "REST collection for the **GainMiles Product API** (FastAPI + PostgreSQL).\n\n### 先決條件 (Prerequisites)\n1. `python setup_env.py`\n2. `docker compose -p gainmiles-test up -d --wait --wait-timeout 120 db`\n3. `alembic upgrade head`\n4. `python -m app.seed` *(可選，載入四筆範例商品)*\n5. `uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8123`\n\n### 設定 (Configuration)\n於環境變數 `baseUrl` 設定服務位址，預設為 `http://127.0.0.1:8123`。\n\n### 執行順序 (Run order)\n資料夾順序即為建議的執行順序。**Create** 會把伺服器指派的 `id` 存入 collection 變數 `productId`，後續的 Read / Update / Delete 會沿用；**Delete** 之後再讀取會得到 404。\n\n`unit_price` 一律以兩位小數字串回傳，`sizes` / `colors` 一律以排序後的陣列回傳。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "API Docs",
      "description": "FastAPI 內建的 OpenAPI 文件與 Swagger UI。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "OpenAPI document",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Content type is JSON', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Lists both product paths', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.openapi).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.paths).to.have.property('/api/v1/products');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.paths).to.have.property('/api/v1/products/{product_id}');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('DocOperations for products are exposed', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.paths['/api/v1/products']).to.have.property('get');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.paths['/api/v1/products']).to.have.property('post');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.paths['/api/v1/products/{product_id}']).to.have.property('delete');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openapi.json",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "openapi.json"
              ]
            },
            "description": "OpenAPI 3 schema，用於匯入或檢查端點契約。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Swagger UI",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Serves an HTML page', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('text/html');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('swagger');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/docs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "docs"
              ]
            },
            "description": "互動式 API 文件（瀏覽器開啟較合適）。"
          },
          "response": []
